# Commands run by the launchd job com.hakios.demo (see com.hakios.demo.plist).
# A long run of everything at once (RAM boot, ~9 minutes, under the ten-minute restart): Wi-Fi (boot-args pcie=5
# pcie_delay=60 wifi=8), swipes and Settings as rc.jobs.scroll, the network checked, then the home screen idle and
# swiped again now and then -- for hangs (11-10: an APM watchdog reset once at a swipe's start).
/redwood/bin/rwtouch wait 30 swipe 0.5 0.985 0.5 0.3 200 wait 8
/redwood/bin/rwtouch swipe 0.85 0.5 0.15 0.5 300 wait 1 swipe 0.15 0.5 0.85 0.5 300 wait 1 swipe 0.85 0.5 0.15 0.5 300 wait 1 swipe 0.15 0.5 0.85 0.5 300 wait 2
/redwood/bin/rwtouch tap 0.376 0.758 wait 5 zigzag 0.5 0.75 0.35 500 6 wait 2 swipe 0.5 0.8 0.5 0.3 150 wait 2 button home wait 3
/redwood/bin/net_test waitaddr en0 150 wait 10 resolve example.com fetch https://www.apple.com/library/test/success.html
/redwood/bin/rwtouch wait 60 swipe 0.85 0.5 0.15 0.5 300 wait 1 swipe 0.15 0.5 0.85 0.5 300 wait 60 swipe 0.85 0.5 0.15 0.5 300 wait 1 swipe 0.15 0.5 0.85 0.5 300 wait 60
/redwood/bin/rwtouch tap 0.376 0.758 wait 5 zigzag 0.5 0.75 0.35 500 6 wait 2 button home wait 60 swipe 0.85 0.5 0.15 0.5 300 wait 1 swipe 0.15 0.5 0.85 0.5 300 wait 60
/redwood/bin/net_test fetch https://www.apple.com/library/test/success.html
/redwood/bin/fps_info
